{
    "title": "Avis Car Rental",
    "description": "Discover a better rental car experience with the new Avis app. With 5,000+ locations in 165 countries, we are one of the world's best-known car rental companies.  Whether traveling for business, family vacation, or weekend getaway, we know you want to get on the road as quickly as possible. The Avis app makes renting a car simple, speedy, and hassle-free with control of your journey from start to finish in the palm of your hands.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nLowest Prices*: Log in for our best available prices.\r\nSeamless Reservations: Find and reserve a car in a few simple steps. Choose from a wide range of vehicles, including SUVs, vans, EVs, trucks, compact cars, and more options to suit your needs and budget.\r\nManage Your Booking: Easily view, modify, or cancel your reservations directly from the app.\r\nKeep track of your rental details and upcoming trips all in one place.\r\nContactless Rentals: Skip the line and go straight to your car with Avis Preferred**. Enjoy a\r\nseamless experience with our contactless rental options.\r\nPreferred Member Benefits**: choose your car, bypass the counter, earn Avis points on eligible rentals, redeem points for free days or rental extras 24/7 Dedicated Support: Get assistance whenever you need it with our dedicated customer service team. We\u2019re here to help you every step of the way.\r\nRoadside Assistance: If you experience trouble on the road, contact roadside assistance directly from the app.\r\nLocation Finder: Find the nearest Avis location with ease. Use the app to get directions, phone numbers, hours of operation, and available vehicle options. \r\nThousands of Locations: select your car rental from one, or more, of our airport and city locations across the globe.\r\n\r\nFor the lowest price, the shortest wait, and dedicated customer service, download the new Avis car rental app today. Plan on the Avis app.\r\n\r\nContact us:\r\n\r\nPhone: 1.800.398.284\r\nEmail: avisapp@avisbudget.com\r\n\r\n*Terms & Conditions apply. Visit avis.com/bestprice for details.\r\n**Available at select locations and identity verification required on first Preferred rental. See\r\navis.com/preferred for details.",
